---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Architecture & Tech Stack Deep Dive | Deslopify Studio"
  description="Technical specifications, deterministic safeguards, latency budgets, and infrastructure patterns behind Deslopify AI systems."
>
  <div class="subpage-container">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <span class="page-badge">Technical Deep Dive</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">
        Systems Architecture &<br>
        <span class="gradient-text">Deterministic Engineering.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        How we eliminate hallucinations, enforce sub-500ms response budgets, and guarantee enterprise-grade data isolation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Architecture Pillars Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 60px;">
      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #eef1ff; color: var(--blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-bottom: 12px;">Sub-450ms Latency Budget</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--gray);">
          We leverage Redis semantic vector caching, streaming token chunks over WebSockets, and speculative query execution to deliver instant feedback before the full payload is processed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #eef1ff; color: var(--blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          🛡️
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-bottom: 12px;">Deterministic Guardrails</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--gray);">
          Strict Pydantic schema decoding ensures every model response conforms to exact typed data contracts. Malformed outputs trigger automated repair passes or fallback handlers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #eef1ff; color: var(--blue); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          🔒
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-bottom: 12px;">Enterprise Isolation</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--gray);">
          All client inference runs through zero-data-retention enterprise API endpoints or dedicated on-premise VPCs. Data is never used for foundation model pre-training.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Technical Pipeline Diagram / Code Block -->
    <div style="background: #1f1f32; border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 80px; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); padding-bottom: 16px;">
        <span style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; color: var(--blue-soft);">// ARCHITECTURE FLOW: AGENTIC EXECUTION PIPELINE</span>
        <span style="font-size: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px;">TypeScript & Python</span>
      </div>

      <pre style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; color: #e5e8f6;"><code>
[Client Request: Web / Mobile / API]
       │
       ▼
[Edge Gateway: Cloudflare Workers + Rate Limiter]
       │
       ├──► Check Semantic Cache (Redis Vector Index) ──► (Cache Hit: &lt;45ms response)
       │
       ▼ (Cache Miss)
[FastAPI / BullMQ Orchestration Layer]
       │
       ├──► Intent Routing & Speculative RAG (Pinecone / Hybrid Search)
       ├──► Claude 3.5 Sonnet / Vision Inference with Structured Schema
       │
       ▼
[Pydantic Validation & Guardrail Gate]
       │
       ├──► Pass: Stream Tokens to Client via WebSockets
       └──► Fail: Fast Repair Pass &rarr; Fallback Deterministic Workflow
       │
       ▼
[Telemetry & Audit Log: LangSmith + OpenTelemetry]
      </code></pre>
    </div>

    <!-- Tech Stack Integration Table -->
    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--card-gray); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); margin-bottom: 80px;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-bottom: 24px;">
        Battle-Tested Engineering Stack
      </h2>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
        <div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">LLM & Vision Models</h4>
          <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray);">
            <li>• Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet</li>
            <li>• OpenAI GPT-4o & Text-Embedding-3</li>
            <li>• Open-weights: Llama 3.3 & DeepSeek</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">Agent Frameworks</h4>
          <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray);">
            <li>• LangGraph & LangChain</li>
            <li>• LlamaIndex Vector Pipelines</li>
            <li>• Temporal.io Durable Execution</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">Data & Cache Stores</h4>
          <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray);">
            <li>• Pinecone & Qdrant Vector DBs</li>
            <li>• Redis Semantic & Memory Cache</li>
            <li>• PostgreSQL & Supabase</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">Frontend & Mobile</h4>
          <ul style="list-style: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--gray);">
            <li>• Astro (Static & SSR Performance)</li>
            <li>• Next.js & React Server Components</li>
            <li>• React Native & SwiftUI</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h3 style="font-family: var(--jakarta); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink-heading); margin-bottom: 12px;">Need a custom architecture review?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 24px;">We audit your current codebase, API latencies, and token costs at zero charge.</p>
      <a class="submit-btn-primary" href="/contact-us" style="max-width: 260px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Schedule Architecture Audit
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
